# Ignore files and directories starting with a dot followed by uppercase letters
.[A-Z]*

# Standard Go ignores
bin/
obj/
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
vendor/
*.log

# Walk-tier per-project secrets (internal/credential): the AES-256-GCM
# master key and the credentials file it encrypts. Never commit either,
# even though the credentials file itself holds only ciphertext.
.pleiades/

# Manually built binaries from local `go build -o <name> ./cmd/<name>`
# verification runs (each cmd/ subdirectory's own name). Not *.exe-style
# extensions, so the Standard Go ignores above miss them.
/controller
/runner
/pleiades
/docs-lint